@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@csrf = replace-from-csrf-response
@classId = replace
@assessmentId = replace

### Bootstrap anonymous CSRF and retain cookie in the client
GET {{base}}/auth/csrf

### Login (use CSRF from previous response)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"email":"student001@seed.invalid","password":"replace-test-secret"}

### Scoped classes
GET {{base}}/classes?page=1&pageSize=20

### Read draft
GET {{base}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/submission

### Save changed draft
PATCH {{base}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/submission
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"expectedRevision":0,"textAnswer":"Bản nháp của tôi"}

### Final submit, safe retry uses identical key and payload
POST {{base}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/submission/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: 2d82bf12-cfd7-4e39-9726-ccb18854b99a

{"expectedRevision":1,"textAnswer":"Bài nộp cuối cùng"}

### Permission denial example: another learner's guessed result is not an exposed route
GET {{base}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/result

### Protected material download with Range
GET {{base}}/materials/replace-material-id/download
Range: bytes=0-1023
